#: ../../../release/dev/FindOpenMP-offload-target.rst:2
msgid "FindOpenMP-offload-target"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release/dev/FindOpenMP-offload-target.rst:4
msgid ""
"The :module:`FindOpenMP` module now provides "
"``OpenMP::OpenMP_<lang>_Offload`` imported targets for code whose OpenMP "
"``target`` regions may be offloaded to a device.  Offload is enabled with "
"the new ``OpenMP_<lang>_OFFLOAD`` and ``OpenMP_<lang>_OFFLOAD_FLAGS`` "
"variables."
msgstr ""
